A quarterly review of the new-build market across Slovakia. Supply stands at {natStockEn} flats across {natTowns} towns. The pace of sales differs between them by a factor of {natSpreadEn}: in {natFastest} the current offer would clear in {natFastestMoEn} months, in {natSlowest} in {natSlowestMoEn}.
